# The repo-root .gitignore excludes *.cobaltlog / *.error / *.output so stray
# Cobalt artifacts do not pile up in the working tree. Inside THIS directory
# they are the primary evidence for S1 and must be committed, so re-include
# them. Keep this file if a later run drops a new <jobid>.* triplet here.
!*.cobaltlog
!*.error
!*.output
